॰ this language can say "none": an arena is born with one slot and nothing
॰ shrinks it. अवकाशमूल्यानि asks that question first, and says so.
॰ ॥ PROBE — THE SAME WRITE, FROM A DIFFERENT MODULE ॥ (2026-09-18)
